{"id": "52326", "title": "变态学生会长", "author": "annom", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 28, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/52/52326.htm", "intro": "~~~~绿荫学院~~~~高一三班 上课的铃声已经响过了，教室里一片安静。过了好一会儿，老师才慢慢走来：“同学们，今天给你们介绍一位新同学。”他指了指身後的少年。 少年本是低垂著头，此刻却抬了起来，目光缓缓的绕了教室一周，他有著一头瀑布般的长发，眼中眼波流转，风情别具，一身简单的运动服恰到好处的衬托出他修长结实的身材。俊美的容颜上毫无表情，直到他的眼对上了另外一双眼神，他的目光便再也没有转开，只是一心一意的看著那双眼睛的主人，连老师在一旁唠叨著什麽也没听见。 还是老话恶趣味的狂下吧  SM", "base": "files/article/html/52/52326", "chapters": [{"title": "第1章", "file": "7414343.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2章", "file": "7414344.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3，4章", "file": "7414347.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5章", "file": "7414350.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6章", "file": "7414352.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7章", "file": "7414354.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8章", "file": "7414356.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9章", "file": "7414359.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10章", "file": "7414360.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11章", "file": "7414361.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12章", "file": "7414364.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13章", "file": "7414367.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14章", "file": "7414368.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15章", "file": "7414369.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16章", "file": "7414370.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17章", "file": "7414371.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18章", "file": "7414372.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19章", "file": "7414374.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20章", "file": "7414376.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21章", "file": "7414378.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22章", "file": "7414381.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第23章", "file": "7414385.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第24章", "file": "7414386.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第25章", "file": "7414387.html", "available": false}, {"tit